,"1897 AD","1905 AD","1919 AD"]}},{"id":"c9-q50","chapter":"अध्याय 3: उदारवादी एवं राष्ट्रवादी (1857–1919)","question":{"hi":"बंगाल विभाजन किस वायसराय के समय हुआ?","en":"Who was the Viceroy of India when the Partition of Bengal was enacted?"},"options":{"hi":["लॉर्ड कर्जन","लॉर्ड रिपन","लॉर्ड डलहौजी","लॉर्ड माउंटबेटन"],"en":["Lord Curzon","Lord Ripon","Lord Dalhousie","Lord Mountbatten"]}},{"id":"c9-q51","chapter":"अध्याय 3: उदारवादी एवं राष्ट्रवादी (1857–1919)","question":{"hi":"स्वदेशी आंदोलन का संबंध किस घटना से था?","en":"The Swadeshi Movement was triggered as a direct reaction to which historical event?"},"options":{"hi":["बंगाल विभाजन","भारत छोड़ो आंदोलन","असहयोग आंदोलन","सविनय अवज्ञा आंदोलन"],"en":["Partition of Bengal","Quit India Movement","Non-Cooperation Movement","Civil Disobedience Movement"]}},{"id":"c9-q52","chapter":"अध्याय 3: उदारवादी एवं राष्ट्रवादी (1857–1919)","question":{"hi":"स्वदेशी आंदोलन में किसका बहिष्कार किया गया?","en":"What was primarily boycotted during the Swadeshi Movement?"},"options":{"hi":["विदेशी वस्तुओं का","भारतीय वस्तुओं का","भारतीय शिक्षा का","भारतीय समाचार-पत्रों का"],"en":["Foreign/British imported goods","Indian products","Indigenous gurukuls","Nationalist newspapers"]}},{"id":"c9-q53","chapter":"अध्याय 3: उदारवादी एवं राष्ट्रवादी (1857–1919)","question":{"hi":"लाल-बाल-पाल में ''लाल'' किसे कहा जाता था?","en":"Who was referred to as ''Lal'' in the famous trio Lal-Bal-Pal?"},"options":{"hi":["लाला लाजपत राय","बाल गंगाधर तिलक","बिपिन चंद्र पाल","लाला हरदयाल"],"en":["Lala Lajpat Rai","Bal Gangadhar Tilak","Bipin Chandra Pal","Lala Har Dayal"]}},{"id":"c9-q54","chapter":"अध्याय 3: उदारवादी एवं राष्ट्रवादी (1857–1919)","question":{"hi":"लाल-बाल-पाल में ''बाल'' कौन थे?","en":"Who was ''Bal'' in the famous trio Lal-Bal-Pal?"},"options":{"hi":["बाल गंगाधर तिलक","बिपिन चंद्र पाल","लाला लाजपत राय","गोपाल कृष्ण गोखले"],"en":["Bal Gangadhar Tilak","Bipin Chandra Pal","Lala Lajpat Rai","Gopal Krishna Gokhale"]}},{"id":"c9-q55","chapter":"अध्याय 3: उदारवादी एवं राष्ट्रवादी (1857–1919)","question":{"hi":"लाल-बाल-पाल में ''पाल'' कौन थे?","en":"Who was ''Pal'' in the famous trio Lal-Bal-Pal?"},"options":{"hi":["लाला लाजपत राय","बाल गंगाधर तिलक","बिपिन चंद्र पाल","दादाभाई नौरोजी"],"en":["Lala Lajpat Rai","Bal Gangadhar Tilak","Bipin Chandra Pal","Dadabhai Naoroji"]}},{"id":"c9-q56","chapter":"अध्याय 3: उदारवादी एवं राष्ट्रवादी (1857–1919)","question":{"hi":"मुस्लिम लीग की स्थापना किस वर्ष हुई?","en":"In which year was the All-India Muslim League founded?"},"options":{"hi":["1885 ई.","1905 ई.","1906 ई.","1919 ई."],"en":["1885 AD","1905 AD","1906 AD","1919 AD"]}},{"id":"c9-q57","chapter":"अध्याय 3: उदारवादी एवं राष्ट्रवादी (1857–1919)","question":{"hi":"होमरूल आंदोलन से संबंधित प्रमुख नेता कौन थे?","en":"Who were the principal leaders associated with the Home Rule Movement?"},"options":{"hi":["बाल गंगाधर तिलक एवं एनी बेसेंट","भगत सिंह एवं राजगुरु","गांधी एवं पटेल","नेहरू एवं सुभाष बोस"],"en":["Bal Gangadhar Tilak and Annie Besant","Bhagat Singh and Rajguru","Gandhi and Patel","Nehru and Subhash Bose"]}},{"id":"c9-q58","chapter":"अध्याय 3: उदारवादी एवं राष्ट्रवादी (1857–1919)","question":{"hi":"होमरूल आंदोलन का प्रमुख उद्देश्य क्या था?","en":"What was the primary goal of the Home Rule Movement?"},"options":{"hi":["भारत में स्वशासन प्राप्त करना","ब्रिटिश शासन मजबूत करना","विदेशी व्यापार बढ़ाना","भारतीय उद्योग समाप्त करना"],"en":["Achieving self-government / Swaraj within British Commonwealth","Solidifying British rule","Expanding colonial trade","Abolishing Indian craft"]}},{"id":"c9-q59","chapter":"अध्याय 3: उदारवादी एवं राष्ट्रवादी (1857–1919)","question":{"hi":"उदारवादी एवं राष्ट्रवादी नेताओं में प्रमुख अंतर किस बात को लेकर था?","en":"What was the fundamental difference between Moderate and Nationalist (Extremist) leaders?"},"options":{"hi":["राजनीतिक अधिकार प्राप्त करने के तरीकों को लेकर","शिक्षा के महत्व को लेकर","कृषि उत्पादन को लेकर","भारतीय भाषाओं को लेकर"],"en":["Methods and strategies for securing political rights","Valuing education","Agricultural harvests","Indigenous linguistic pride"]}},{"id":"c9-q60","chapter":"अध्याय 3: उदारवादी एवं राष्ट्रवादी (1857–1919)","question":{"hi":"स्वदेशी आंदोलन ने राष्ट्रीय आंदोलन को कैसे प्रभावित किया?","en":"How did the Swadeshi Movement profoundly impact the freedom struggle?"},"options":{"hi":["राष्ट्रीय जागरूकता एवं स्वदेशी उद्योगों को प्रोत्साहित करके","राष्ट्रीय भावना समाप्त करके","विदेशी वस्तुओं पर निर्भरता बढ़ाकर","भारतीय उद्योगों का विरोध करके"],"en":["By inspiring national consciousness and indigenous industries","By stifling patriotic spirit","By cementing reliance on foreign goods","By opposing native enterprise"]}}]'::jsonb,1,true) on conflict (id) do update set title=excluded.title,class_level=excluded.class_level,subject=excluded.subject,chapter=excluded.chapter,duration_minutes=excluded.duration_minutes,total_marks=excluded.total_marks,questions=excluded.questions,attempt_limit=excluded.attempt_limit,is_published=excluded.is_published,updated_at=now();
